      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What does Ни́на Петро́вна offer everyone? (предлага́ю: I offer)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6000
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Предлага́ю всем чай.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Посмотри́те. Па́па говори́т по-англи́йски, а я перевожу́: па́па говори́т, что они́ гордя́тся мной.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7680
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Translating is passing words on: говори́т, что, in green, and then his words.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:5y2wj9'
    '|a||Ма́ма спра́шивает, давно́ ли вы живёте в э́том до́ме.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:n65ffx'
    '|a||You know ли from lesson 113: the word asked about, давно́, then ли, in blue.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:15sj6xa'
    '|a||«Я ра́да.» Она́ говори́т, что ра́да. Я becomes она́, and the tense stays.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ckrjfq'
    '|a||«Вы давно́ здесь живёте?» Она́ спра́шивает, давно́ ли вы здесь живёте. Вы stays вы.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1fvj2vj'
    '|a||«Сади́тесь!» Она́ про́сит, что́бы вы се́ли: a request, что́бы and the past form, in pink.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:16r3qqc'
    '|a||Но́вые слова́. Переводи́ть, перевести́: to translate. Я перевожу́, переведу́, перевёл. Я — перево́дчик.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:v1fy4'
    '|a||Представля́ть, предста́вить: to introduce. Позво́льте предста́вить: мои́ роди́тели.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:129epiu'
    '|a||Благодари́ть you know. Поблагодари́ть: once. Ма́ма хо́чет вас поблагодари́ть.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:8pjtyz'
    '|a||Предложи́ть you know. Предлага́ть is its doing partner: предлага́ю всем чай.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1ef0148'
    '|a||And переда́ть: передава́ть. Па́па передаёт приве́т.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:o4u4rc'
    '|a||Слы́шать, услы́шать: to hear. Вы меня́ слы́шите? Я услы́шал но́вое сло́во.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1csfolp'
    '|a||Обы́чай: a custom. Чай — англи́йский обы́чай. Го́рдость: pride. Сын — их го́рдость.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:nu76z1'
    '|a||Чужо́й: someone else''s, foreign. Ло́ндон — мой родно́й го́род, а Петербу́рг мне уже́ не чужо́й.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:fuepag'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы. Что, ли и́ли что́бы? Вы́берите.':
